# @APP_NAME@ @VERSION@

@APP_NAME@ is a free, open-source (MIT) macOS launcher and instant AI action overlay. It is keyboard-first, fast, and sends no telemetry.

## What is new

@HIGHLIGHTS@

The full history is in [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/@REPO@/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md).

## Requirements

- macOS 26 or later.
- Apple Silicon (arm64). There is no Intel build.
- At least one AI provider for the chat features: a local OpenAI-compatible server, a hosted API key, or a CLI subscription. The launcher, math, and system tools need none.

